[statement]
A name a kept package's `install_if` condition names does not hold back
the removal of a package losing it: `q` takes `y` from the installed `p`,
and the kept `k` names `y` in its condition, so apk removes `p` first, as
where nothing names `y`
(`a-package-losing-a-name-nothing-else-needs-is-removed-first`).

[repository]
P:a
V:1

P:q
V:1
p:y=2

[installed]
P:p
V:1
p:y=1

P:k
V:1
i:y

[world]
k

[request]
a
q

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
remove p 1
install a 1
install q 1
